    note for DocumentObject "doc / text_chunk / table / code / image 五种对象统一承载；excluded 为 PRD 之外的实现补字段"

    class Project {
        <<ORM>>
        +str id
        +str tenant_id
        +str name
        +UUID created_by
    }

    class ProjectMember {
        <<ORM>>
        +str project_id
        +UUID user_id
        +datetime expires_at
    }

    class AclGrant {
        <<ORM>>
        +UUID id
        +str object_id
        +str subject
        +str effect
        +str status
        +UUID granted_by
        +datetime expires_at
    }
    note for AclGrant "need-to-know 的权威源；pending 期间不写 acl_allow（A7）"

    %% ── 关系 ───────────────────────────────────────────
    UserScope *-- DocumentScope : 组合（base）
    SecurityScope ..> UserScope : 签发（唯一入口）
    ScopedQuery *-- UserScope : 绑定（scope 恒同一实例）
    ScopedQuery ..> ScopePredicate : with_text 后 scope 不变 ⇒ 同一 pred
    SecurityScope ..> ScopePredicate : build
    UserScope ..> ScopePredicate : predicate()
    SecurityPolicy ..> ScopePredicate : 消费
    SecurityPolicy ..> ObjectACLView : 消费
    SecurityPolicy ..> Decision : 产出
    SecurityPolicy ..> DocumentScope : to_sql 内部复用 document_scope_clause
    DocumentObject --> Document : document_id FK
    DocumentObject --> DocumentObject : parent_object_id（OCR 派生 → 源图片）
    Document --> User : owner_id FK
    ProjectMember --> Project : project_id FK
    ProjectMember --> User : user_id FK
    AclGrant --> DocumentObject : object_id
    SecurityCascade ..> DocumentObject : 物化 / 级联
    SecurityCascade ..> Document : 双写（documents 行）
    ImageSecurity ..> SecurityCascade : escalate → cascade_image_derived
    AclGrant ..> DocumentObject : approved 后物化进 acl_allow
